        <ul class="components">
          <li>
            <article class="component" id="c-01" aria-labelledby="c-01-h">
              <div class="c-head"><span class="label c-id">C-01</span><span class="label">Component</span></div>
              <div class="c-body">
                <h3 id="c-01-h">Internal developer platform for AI-assisted delivery</h3>
                <p>A Claude Code platform for a whole engineering team: a plugin of 21 skills and 3 hook events for spec-first authoring, test-driven implementation and cross-vendor adversarial review, plus a versioned engineering-standards baseline that fans out automatically to about 26 repositories.</p>
              </div>
              <dl class="c-meta">
                <dt class="label">Tags</dt>
                <dd><ul class="tags"><li>Agentic AI</li><li>Developer Experience</li><li>CI/CD</li></ul></dd>
              </dl>
            </article>
          </li>
          <li>
            <article class="component" id="c-02" aria-labelledby="c-02-h">
              <div class="c-head"><span class="label c-id">C-02</span><span class="label">Component</span></div>
              <div class="c-body">
                <h3 id="c-02-h">Agent execution and evaluation platform</h3>
                <p>An agent execution and evaluation platform. Coding agents take specified work, build in sandboxed containers with per-run credentials, pass rubric-graded review gates and merge on automated criteria. The platform choice was settled by a measured spike: 3.3 s cold start, 32 ms warm.</p>
              </div>
              <dl class="c-meta">
                <dt class="label">Tags</dt>
                <dd><ul class="tags"><li>AI Agents</li><li>Cloudflare Containers</li><li>Queues</li></ul></dd>
              </dl>
            </article>
          </li>
          <li>
            <article class="component" id="c-03" aria-labelledby="c-03-h">
              <div class="c-head"><span class="label c-id">C-03</span><span class="label">Component</span></div>
              <div class="c-body">
                <h3 id="c-03-h">Passkey and verifiable-credential identity</h3>
                <p>Built from scratch: did:web identity with WebAuthn passkeys and W3C Verifiable Credentials, in production as the sign-in for a suite of internal applications, with federation to self-hosted DIDs — including this domain.</p>
              </div>
              <dl class="c-meta">
                <dt class="label">Tags</dt>
                <dd><ul class="tags"><li>WebAuthn</li><li>did:web</li><li>Verifiable Credentials</li></ul></dd>
              </dl>
            </article>
          </li>
          <li>
            <article class="component" id="c-04" aria-labelledby="c-04-h">
              <div class="c-head"><span class="label c-id">C-04</span><span class="label">Component</span></div>
              <div class="c-body">
                <h3 id="c-04-h">Infrastructure as code</h3>
                <p>Cloud and SaaS infrastructure run through Terraform Cloud with GitOps — plan on pull request, apply on merge, daily drift detection — across GitHub, Cloudflare, Kafka, Databricks and observability. AWS and Microsoft 365 as code; joiners and leavers automated.</p>
              </div>
              <dl class="c-meta">
                <dt class="label">Tags</dt>
                <dd><ul class="tags"><li>Terraform</li><li>GitOps</li><li>Cloudflare</li></ul></dd>
              </dl>
            </article>
          </li>
          <li>
            <article class="component" id="c-05" aria-labelledby="c-05-h">
              <div class="c-head"><span class="label c-id">C-05</span><span class="label">Component</span></div>
              <div class="c-body">
                <h3 id="c-05-h">On-premises speech intelligence</h3>
                <p>A meeting-transcription pipeline on an NVIDIA DGX Spark — NeMo ASR, diarisation and voiceprint speaker naming — for audio that cannot leave the building.</p>
              </div>
              <dl class="c-meta">
                <dt class="label">Tags</dt>
                <dd><ul class="tags"><li>NVIDIA NeMo</li><li>ASR</li><li>On-prem AI</li></ul></dd>
              </dl>
            </article>
          </li>
        </ul>
