      <div class="body prose">
        <p>I studied Electrical and Electronic Engineering (BEng), then trained as a maths teacher (PGCE, UCL) and taught secondary mathematics for two years. In 2021 I taught myself full-stack development and moved into software, and I have worked in platform engineering since 2023.</p>
        <p>Teaching shaped how I build tooling: it only counts if people pick it up and use it well.</p>
